of dropping the code:

--- 2.4.8pre5aa1/arch/alpha/kernel/smp.c.~1~	Wed Jul  4 04:03:45 2001
+++ 2.4.8pre5aa1/arch/alpha/kernel/smp.c	Tue Aug  7 14:29:25 2001
